WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:17.418
Tina: I can't believe how Danny and Brad are acting.

2
00:00:17.419 --> 00:00:19.310
They should know better.

3
00:00:19.311 --> 00:00:26.894
Tina: I can't believe Danny would fight with me!

4
00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:30.984
Billy: Tina cry?

5
00:00:30.985 --> 00:00:32.928
Tina: I'm okay.

6
00:00:32.929 --> 00:00:35.798
Billy: Tina sad.

7
00:00:35.799 --> 00:00:42.012
Tina: Yes, I'm a little sad.

8
00:00:42.013 --> 00:00:45.925
Billy: Happy picture.

9
00:00:45.926 --> 00:00:48.554
Tina: You're so sweet.

10
00:00:48.555 --> 00:00:51.143
Tina: I'm just sad about my friends.

11
00:00:51.144 --> 00:00:54.092
Billy: Brad and Danny!

12
00:00:54.093 --> 00:00:56.222
Tina: You like them, I know.

13
00:00:56.223 --> 00:01:00.491
Tina: But we . . . we are having a fight.

14
00:01:00.492 --> 00:01:02.127
Billy: Why?

15
00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:04.708
Tina: Some mean boys hurt Danny.

16
00:01:04.709 --> 00:01:06.986
Danny is angry.

17
00:01:06.987 --> 00:01:10.653
Billy: Grr!

18
00:01:10.654 --> 00:01:15.841
Tina: That's right. Now, Danny wants to hurt the mean boys.

19
00:01:15.842 --> 00:01:17.886
Billy: Hurt is bad!

20
00:01:17.887 --> 00:01:20.113
Tina: I think so too, Billy.

21
00:01:20.114 --> 00:01:22.593
I won't hurt the mean boys.

22
00:01:22.594 --> 00:01:26.581
Tina: So, Danny and Brad aren't my friends right now.

23
00:01:26.582 --> 00:01:29.988
Billy: Tina sad.

24
00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:35.290
Tina: I'm sad because I don't know what to do.

25
00:01:35.291 --> 00:01:37.703
Dad: I'm sorry to hear that, sweetie.

26
00:01:37.704 --> 00:01:40.597
Tina: Dad! I didn't know you were there.

27
00:01:40.598 --> 00:01:42.677
Dad: I didn't mean to listen in.

28
00:01:42.678 --> 00:01:45.256
Tina: No, it's okay.

29
00:01:45.257 --> 00:01:48.714
Dad: I'm proud of you for not wanting to hurt the mean boys.

30
00:01:48.715 --> 00:01:52.275
Tina: You've always said that it's not right to hurt people.

31
00:01:52.276 --> 00:01:54.560
Dad: These kids sound like bullies.

32
00:01:54.561 --> 00:01:56.944
Tina: They are.

33
00:01:56.945 --> 00:01:59.898
Tina: And now Danny is being just like them!

34
00:01:59.899 --> 00:02:02.426
He wants to bully the bullies.

35
00:02:02.427 --> 00:02:06.208
Dad: I'm sure you can convince him it's a bad idea.

36
00:02:06.209 --> 00:02:09.159
Tina: I tried, Dad, but he won't listen!

37
00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:11.623
Dad: So you don't know what to do?

38
00:02:11.624 --> 00:02:14.103
Tina: Yeah, I'm stuck.

39
00:02:14.104 --> 00:02:16.867
Dad: Is there someone Danny respects?

40
00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:19.725
Tina: I thought he respected me.

41
00:02:19.726 --> 00:02:21.697
Dad: I'm sure he does.

42
00:02:21.698 --> 00:02:26.597
Dad: I mean, is there an older person that he might listen to?

43
00:02:26.598 --> 00:02:28.705
Tina: Older?

44
00:02:28.706 --> 00:02:32.723
Dad: Sure. You know, someone bigger.

45
00:02:32.724 --> 00:02:37.794
Tina: Someone bigger . . .

46
00:02:37.795 --> 00:02:40.173
Dad: You've thought of someone, haven't you?

47
00:02:40.174 --> 00:02:42.598
Tina: I know the perfect person.

48
00:02:42.599 --> 00:02:45.814
Dad: So . . . now there's no problem.

49
00:02:45.815 --> 00:02:52.056
Tina: Um, no. No problem at all . . .
